This crate (`symphonia-bundle-musepack`) is a from-scratch, pure-Rust reimplementation of the
Musepack (SV7/SV8) audio codec's demuxer and decoder. It is licensed under the Mozilla Public
License, v. 2.0, like the rest of Project Symphonia (see `LICENSE`).

Portions of this crate's algorithms (the bitstream/canonical-huffman readers, SV7/SV8 stream-info
and block parsers, the Huffman code tables, requantization coefficients, the 32-band polyphase
synthesis filter, and the seek-table format) are ported, function-by-function, from the reference
`libmpcdec` implementation found in the MusicPack project
(https://github.com/whepper/musicpack, a maintained continuation of the original musepack.net SVN
tree), which is distributed under the following BSD-3-Clause license:

